<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on property basket.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Tuesday it plans to issue 260 million American-style call warrants on a basket of three blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	     0.06329  shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd    0.02048  shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	    0.03646  shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.045	 PREMIUM	 9.95 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.201	 GEARING	 5.01x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.MAR.98	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$10.05</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
